 "headline": "Murray Drops 43 While Rivals Watch",
 "notes": [
  "Jamal Murray has 43 PTS, 6 3PTM and 3 STL for White Mambas, and LeParth James is losing the 3PTM fight to a guy dropping bombs.",
  "FG% flipped to White Mambas, and LeParth James lost the category with Derrick White shooting 1-8 for 2 PTS. Football players don't miss this often.",
  "Josh Giddey has 23 PTS, 14 REB and 21 AST for White Mambas, and Bam Adebayo added a 24-15-12 line. That is two triple-doubles in one lineup.",
  "theInfamous is down 5-4 on the week because Khaman Maluach sat on the bench with 9 PTS, 5 DREB and 4-6 FG. That one FG% category is the whole gap.",
  "Kevin Huerter shot 1-8 for 2 PTS for theInfamous, and the guy he dropped, Charles Bassey, put up 3 STL in one game for the opponent. Cruel."
 ],
